    "help": "usage: xar-promo [-h] [--version]\n                 {init,start-run,validate,preserve,signoff,plan,build,audit,review,export} ...\n\nCreate, verify, and preserve reusable promotional-video project metadata.\n\npositional arguments:\n  {init,start-run,validate,preserve,signoff,plan,build,audit,review,export}\n    init                create a ProjectConfig and its first bound run without\n                        overwriting files\n    start-run           create another run bound to the current exact\n                        ProjectConfig bytes\n    validate            validate a ProjectConfig, RunManifest, or legacy\n                        showcase v1 manifest\n    preserve            copy a file to immutable content-addressed storage and\n                        append its run record\n    signoff             append an explicit human decision bound to preserved\n                        artifact bytes\n    plan                compose and validate a pipeline plan without invoking\n                        providers or writing\n    build               run a composed pipeline and preserve success or\n                        failure material in its run\n    audit               write and preserve an automated audit without creating\n                        human approval\n    review              plan or create a pending human-review package without\n                        recording sign-off\n    export              validate or create an offline release bundle from an\n                        explicit policy\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --version             show program's version number and exit\n",
    "plan": "usage: xar-promo plan [-h] --workdir WORKDIR --composer COMPOSER\n                      [--validate-only]\n                      document\n\npositional arguments:\n  document             native ProjectConfig or RunManifest\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help           show this help message and exit\n  --workdir WORKDIR    fresh attempt path to validate without creating\n  --composer COMPOSER  project PipelineComposer as MODULE:ATTRIBUTE\n  --validate-only      explicitly request the command's always-read-only\n                       validation mode\n",
    "build": "usage: xar-promo build [-h] --workdir WORKDIR --composer COMPOSER\n                       [--offline-tts] [--max-tts-attempts MAX_TTS_ATTEMPTS]\n                       [--retry-backoff-seconds RETRY_BACKOFF_SECONDS]\n                       run_manifest\n\npositional arguments:\n  run_manifest          native RunManifest\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --workdir WORKDIR     fresh attempt directory\n  --composer COMPOSER   project PipelineComposer as MODULE:ATTRIBUTE\n  --offline-tts\n  --max-tts-attempts MAX_TTS_ATTEMPTS\n  --retry-backoff-seconds RETRY_BACKOFF_SECONDS\n",
    "init": "usage: xar-promo init [-h] [--project-id PROJECT_ID] [--title TITLE]\n                      [--adapter ADAPTER] [--preset PRESET] [--run-id RUN_ID]\n                      [--narration-locale NARRATION_LOCALE]\n                      [--subtitle-locale SUBTITLE_LOCALES]\n                      project_directory\n\npositional arguments:\n  project_directory\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --project-id PROJECT_ID\n                        portable stable id; defaults to the directory name\n  --title TITLE         human title; defaults to the directory name\n  --adapter ADAPTER     project adapter id (default: generic)\n  --preset PRESET       style preset id (default: default)\n  --run-id RUN_ID       initial run id (default: run-0001)\n  --narration-locale NARRATION_LOCALE\n                        primary narration locale (default: und)\n  --subtitle-locale SUBTITLE_LOCALES\n                        required subtitle locale; repeat for multiple locales\n                        (default: narration locale)\n",
    "preserve": "usage: xar-promo preserve [-h] [--run-manifest RUN_MANIFEST]\n                          --artifact-id ARTIFACT_ID --collection {raw,derived}\n                          --role ROLE [--label LABEL]\n                          [--media-type MEDIA_TYPE]\n                          source\n\npositional arguments:\n  source\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --run-manifest RUN_MANIFEST\n  --artifact-id ARTIFACT_ID\n  --collection {raw,derived}\n  --role ROLE           semantic role such as capture, audio, subtitle, or\n                        deliverable\n  --label LABEL\n  --media-type MEDIA_TYPE\n",
    "review": "usage: xar-promo review [-h] --storyboard STORYBOARD --probe PROBE\n                        --output-directory OUTPUT_DIRECTORY\n                        --audit-directory AUDIT_DIRECTORY --ffmpeg FFMPEG\n                        [--working-directory WORKING_DIRECTORY] [--plan-only]\n                        deliverable\n\npositional arguments:\n  deliverable\n\noptions:\n  -h, --help            show this help message and exit\n  --storyboard STORYBOARD\n                        storyboard timeline JSON\n  --probe PROBE         retained xar-promo-bound-media-probe v1 envelope for\n                        the deliverable\n  --output-directory OUTPUT_DIRECTORY\n  --audit-directory AUDIT_DIRECTORY\n  --ffmpeg FFMPEG       ffmpeg executable or path\n  --working-directory WORKING_DIRECTORY\n  --plan-only           validate inputs and print the frame plan without\n                        creating directories or files\n"
  },
